      "translationZh": "NeMo-RL（Megatron-Core + vLLM），配合 NeMo-Gym 环境",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0111",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "269fabc182b098e2",
      "translationZh": "比率裁剪（最小值 / 最大值）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
