      "sourceHash": "54b53213ef64cc4c",
      "translationZh": "微批次大小",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0115",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "69585fb8aa14e9dd",
      "translationZh": "并行方式",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0116",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e66a4281549b1c7f",
      "translationZh": "张量并行 2–4；不使用流水线并行或上下文并行",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0117",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8f2c2df29a9aa0cc",
      "translationZh": "各阶段之间变化的是每次运行的配置：每步有多少提示和生成结果、上下文有多长、是否运行智能体循环，以及我们以多大力度将策略拉回参考策略。下表逐阶段列出了 30B 训练链的确切设置：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0118",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "de838855e4a6e04e",
