      "translationZh": "终端",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0167",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "49c266baaaa70981",
      "translationZh": "搜索",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0181",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "37bc592f89be6818",
      "translationZh": "所示参数适用于 30B 模型。全局批大小 = prompts/step × generations/prompt（例如，RLVR 的全局批大小为 256 × 16 = 4096）。3B 和 8B 模型采用相同的训练方案和超参数，但阶段更少（参见“三种规模的差异”）；变化的是阶段列表，而不是调节参数。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0182",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e6efdc60054b54cc",
      "translationZh": "KL 调度随奖励类型而定：当奖励客观且可验证时，允许自由探索（RLVR 和 SWE 2 的 KL 均为 0）；当目标是偏好、安全性或嫁接某项特定技能时，则保持接近参考策略（RLHF 和代码增强阶段使用 KL 0.05）。rollout-turns 列统计的是每次 rollout 中 GRPO 本身所见的环境交互次数。在所有情况下，模型都使用完整的真实环境轨迹进行训练。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0183",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "58c63bf0ea8d9306",
      "translationZh": "分阶段训练课程",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0184",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "70f65e2047964450",
      "translationZh": "每个阶段都是一次独立的 RL 训练，具有单一目标和自己的奖励信号。阶段完成后，其策略会导出为 Hugging Face 格式，并成为下一阶段的基础模型，因此整个流水线是一系列暖启动：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0185",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4a8fdf99fc9c5039",
      "translationZh": "8B 和 30B 模型遵循完整的阶梯式流程。3B 模型采用缩短的路径：基础强化学习和对齐，不包含智能体能力训练模块。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0186",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "83316df6e81c821e",
      "translationZh": "奖励信号",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0187",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7a33a1363eb65e63",
      "translationZh": "一个阶段主要由其奖励方式来定义。整个流程中有三种奖励类型，单个阶段可以使用不止一种：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0188",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eff820b6899ce3c1",
      "translationZh": "奖励类型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0189",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c276e5b78d334d75",
      "translationZh": "衡量内容",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0190",
      "kind": "paragraph",
