    },
    {
      "id": "b0192",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "046bec4b082bddec",
      "translationZh": "精确匹配、单元测试、格式检查器、基于真实标准答案的规则检查器",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0193",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "70a2b1546b85abf6",
      "translationZh": "RLVR · 增强器 · SWE",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0194",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1e001e2bb44bbf5b",
      "translationZh": "奖励模型 / LLM 评判器",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0195",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "348dcb686e339361",
      "translationZh": "开放式质量、偏好、安全性、答案正确性",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0196",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4595c55ef7a42c4d",
      "translationZh": "RLVR · 搜索 · RLHF",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0197",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fc911ccca82246ad",
      "translationZh": "智能体任务结果",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0198",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "69c0f23855d3a4cf",
      "translationZh": "模型是否真的在真实环境中解决了一项任务？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0199",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "03fd71a04ab05f91",
      "translationZh": "SWE · 终端 · 搜索",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0200",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2fdfb10838ee49a4",
      "translationZh": "可验证奖励客观且难以被钻空子，因此流程会优先安排这类奖励。基于评判器和偏好的奖励用于处理任何检查器都无法表达的开放式质量。智能体任务结果奖励最为稀疏：往往在一段漫长的工具使用轨迹结束时，才给出单个比特的信号。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0201",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "7e979bd772666b5f",
      "translationZh": "基础强化学习：构建技能",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0202",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e663a323b909fed3",
      "translationZh": "RLVR：可验证奖励强化学习",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0203",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "76e9426a5f7fa388",
      "translationZh": "RLVR 是该流程中的基础阶段，也是数据混合范围最广的阶段：使用一个涵盖多个可验证领域的混合数据集。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
